# Idea evaluation

Follow `.cursor/system-crew/workflows/idea-evaluation.md` and fill `.cursor/system-crew/templates/idea-evaluation.md`.

Evaluate **Feasibility**, **Direction fit**, and **Efficiency**. Verdict: `ADOPT` | `ADOPT_WITH_CHANGES` | `DEFER` | `REJECT`.  
Do not implement before a verdict. Log to `docs/decisions/ideas/` and update its INDEX.  
`REJECT` blocks product adoption, not time-boxed experiment retries. When comparing mutually exclusive approaches visually, prefer per-approach `exp/*` branches and a separate product `ADOPT*` after comparison.
